 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On that day I will summon my servant Eliakim son of Hilkiah",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 8.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will clothe him with your robe and fasten your sash around him",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 7.32,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will hand your authority over to him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 6.68,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He will be a father to those who live in Jerusalem",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 5.97,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I will place the key of the house of David on his shoulder",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 1.67,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "What he opens no one will shut",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 4.73,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "What he shuts no one will open",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He is like a peg in a firm place",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A throne of honor for his father's house",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The glory of the offspring hangs upon him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The small vessels and the jars are his",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When the Assyrian commander came with threats",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 23.93,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Eliakim asked him to speak in Aramaic",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 23.82,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So the people on the wall would not hear the fear",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Rabshakeh stood and called out loudly",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We tore our clothes and went to seek Isaiah",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To hear the word of the Lord of hosts",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To find the guidance that we needed then",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To stand firm in the face of the storm",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is like a peg in a firm place",
